Z||000003||Haze_Performance||08-01-2000||04:21 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Haze_Performance:<BR><B>It belongs to a guy in the Illinois Fiero Club (Jack) Archie just finished the install. Its not tuned in right, Hes still working out some bugs. But my god dose it sound good. 17"s and coil overs all around. I also love how low the engine sits. It looks like a stock install. I was told over 375 HP<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Haze_sig_1.gif">  My Website's  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/WS6_Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>WS6 Fiero</A> &                  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/HMP" TARGET=_blank>H.M.P. </A>||||reg||1
