Z||000008||Archie||08-01-2000||10:46 PM||||This is owner by Jack Wagner of Chicago. Built on a 21K mile car. We installed a 1997 Chevy crate Corvette LT1 with the Chevy Hot Cam, valve springs and 1.6 rockers. Using the stock Getrag 5-speed. This car has the RCC Coilovers and tubular "A" arms all the way around. Ryanne drop spindles on the front.<P>Still doing a little tuning, because the Hot Cam Kit is not supposed to be used with Fuel Injection. The car was loading up at idle with the 1st chip we put in it. Working with a chip "burner" in FL and he keeps modifying the fuel curve. Car is running  almost perfect right now.<P>I have driven this car extensively and it is VERY FAST. This is the 3rd. fastest Fiero I've ever driven (& the other 2 both had NOS).<P>Engine only has about 400 miles so far, thus it hasn't been raced (officially any way).<P>This is a very nice car and Jack has it lookin' good.<P>Archie||||reg||1
Z||000009||jhogans||08-02-2000||03:04 AM||||Archie,<P>How much would a similar setup cost?||||reg||1
Z||000010||BBBAD GT||08-02-2000||09:26 AM||||Archie:  I'm curious how fast is fast as in qtr mile ET/MPH.  I'm really curious how much V8 HP/Torque these Fiero chassis can take, without much high dollar suspension modifications.  Anybody?<P>BTW, anybody know the url for RCC?  I'd like to get more information about their 11" brake kit.  <P>Damn nice Fiero that guy has......<P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/BBBAD_GT_SIG.gif">  <P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/Fiero.htm" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD GT</A><BR><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD 5.0</A>||||reg||5
Z||000011||HYPTNOTiSE||08-03-2000||02:19 AM||||Joe Wynman, had the same(if not the same, very similar) engine in his car longitudnally&lt;--(spelling IT's LATE!) It was a real nice setup, altough a lot of weight was hanging past the rear axles.  Pretty cheap setup too i believe.  Sorry but i didn't take any pics, shoulda!<P>p.s. Remember seeing that car for the first time archie?<P>------------------<BR>       Mike LeCompte<BR>86 Fiero GT 3.2L w/ Nitrous<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.tcac.net/~daddyg/hypsig.gif"> ||||reg||1
