Z||000013||Archie||08-03-2000||10:59 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Dan86gt3.8:<BR><B>Umm what are thoose steel braided lines at the back of the intake, are thoose EGR or something?  Thats a damn clean looking install there archie keep up the good work!  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Thanks, the LT1's are really sharp in a Fiero & Jack has this one cleaned up and ready to show.<P>They are original Vette supply & return fuel lines.<P>Some one asked about cost, you can find the appox. costs of V-8 swaps at <A HREF="http://www.v8archie.com/arch10.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.v8archie.com/arch10.htm</A> <P>Someone asked about performance. Due to the engine being brand new and the owner being one who has enough sense to get used to a car before he races it, all out performance runs have not been done yet.<P>Archie||||reg||1
